{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duck Off</strong> is NOT your average parkour game. It\u2019s a <strong>quack-fueled disaster simulator</strong> where you, a perfectly incompetent duck, attempt to climb your way to glory while everything and everyone actively tries to ruin your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play solo (if you enjoy suffering alone) or in multiplayer, where <strong>pure chaos</strong> unfolds. Every few minutes, the game randomly slaps players with a bizarre mode like <strong>Egg Fight </strong>(throw eggs at everything),<strong> Ice Mode </strong>(your feet are now a skating rink of regret), <strong>or Banana Mode</strong> (yes, bananas. Everywhere. Good luck! You will need it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras/New_Project__12_.png?t=1743027833\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>NO checkpoints.</strong> You fall? That\u2019s on you. You get shoved off by another duck? That\u2019s on you too, but also kinda funny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is designed to <strong>make you suffer in the funniest way possible.</strong> You\u2019ll laugh, you\u2019ll cry, you\u2019ll question why you\u2019re still playing\u2014<strong>but you\u2019ll keep going, because DUCKS never quit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, if you love pain, betrayal, and ducks fight against each other\u2014<strong>WELCOME to Duck Off!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568830/extras/DISCORD.png?t=1743027833\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568830?t=1743027